WEBVTT

00:02.560 --> 00:04.780
The snowflakes flutter
among the neon lights.

00:05.220 --> 00:08.200
The snowflakes diffuse the light,
making it even brighter.

00:08.880 --> 00:11.340
I really enjoy this scene.

00:12.740 --> 00:16.300
This is one of the reasons
why I like snow.

00:19.280 --> 00:19.880
Eh?

00:20.100 --> 00:21.600
Did I say something strange?

00:22.180 --> 00:23.080
No…

00:25.740 --> 00:30.040
Hearing you say you like snow
makes me very happy.

00:31.100 --> 00:33.780
Although I'm well aware that
you're not talking about me,

00:34.040 --> 00:36.620
somehow it just makes me very happy.

00:40.240 --> 00:41.040
Eh?

00:44.840 --> 00:45.660
Eh?

00:51.000 --> 00:53.820
What exactly is the definition of love?

00:55.340 --> 01:00.500
I once confessed to a girl
who often played with me.

01:01.560 --> 01:03.100
But that girl said to me…

01:04.220 --> 01:07.580
You don't actually like me.

01:08.020 --> 01:10.620
You just want to find someone
to live together with.

01:11.980 --> 01:14.120
That was incisive.

01:15.180 --> 01:18.080
I was just feeling incredibly lonely.

01:19.200 --> 01:20.820
Just by chatting with that girl,

01:21.160 --> 01:22.920
I would feel saved.

01:23.840 --> 01:25.320
That's why I confessed to her.

01:27.340 --> 01:30.280
After that, she stopped playing with me.

01:31.340 --> 01:34.460
I think my confession must have hurt her.

01:35.160 --> 01:36.640
Her response

01:36.640 --> 01:38.520
was more shocking than a simple rejection.

01:40.400 --> 01:42.280
However,

01:42.880 --> 01:44.300
if my feelings weren't of love

01:44.700 --> 01:46.980
just as she said,

01:48.500 --> 01:50.680
then what is this feeling

01:51.480 --> 01:53.780
I have now?

01:59.640 --> 02:04.328
(You Are Ms. Servant.)

03:25.720 --> 03:28.970
(Episode 11: "Your prayers are God's prayers")

03:49.800 --> 03:52.020
Good morning, Master Hitoyoshi.

03:53.560 --> 03:54.920
Good morning.

04:02.160 --> 04:03.220
Ah…

04:03.220 --> 04:05.660
No, this is my fault.

04:05.660 --> 04:06.740
It's all my fault.

04:07.060 --> 04:10.220
Miss Yuki has been
having nightmares lately.

04:10.580 --> 04:13.380
If you need someone to
accompany you in sleep, just tell me.

04:13.680 --> 04:14.920
I said that to her.

04:15.560 --> 04:16.860
I actually uttered such a boast.

04:17.540 --> 04:18.760
I really hate

04:19.480 --> 04:20.520
myself!

04:20.920 --> 04:23.260
As a result, I couldn't sleep at all.

04:23.680 --> 04:25.820
Will it affect my health?

04:26.120 --> 04:28.620
And to make matters worse,
it's now the winter vacation.

04:28.620 --> 04:30.740
I have way too much time
to be alone with her.

04:32.600 --> 04:33.880
Master Hitoyoshi.

04:34.500 --> 04:36.120
What's the matter?

04:37.020 --> 04:37.719
Nothing.

04:37.720 --> 04:40.120
Today we're doing the annual big clean-up.

04:40.120 --> 04:42.180
So I plan to get up earlier…

04:43.100 --> 04:43.980
This excuse

04:44.520 --> 04:46.980
seems far-fetched.

05:04.220 --> 05:06.060
What on earth am I doing?

05:07.240 --> 05:09.220
It can't go on like this,

05:10.000 --> 05:12.020
whether for her or me.

05:13.380 --> 05:15.360
Sorry, Hitoyoshi.

05:16.620 --> 05:19.780
But even if I let her know my feelings,

05:20.760 --> 05:22.340
it wouldn't come to anything, right?

05:23.060 --> 05:24.880
Because Miss Yuki…

05:37.940 --> 05:38.940
Mopping the floor.

05:39.620 --> 05:42.220
This is my second time mopping
the floor since I came here.

05:43.140 --> 05:45.110
HUMILIATED
Although I was totally humiliated last time,

05:46.040 --> 05:48.460
today is a good opportunity
to redeem myself.

05:48.880 --> 05:50.160
I'm going to make the floor shine.

05:50.600 --> 05:53.080
By doing this, Master Hitoyoshi
will surely perk up.

05:55.360 --> 05:56.420
Miss Yuki.

05:56.640 --> 05:58.100
Is there any more trash?

05:59.700 --> 06:00.840
Deja vu.

06:01.420 --> 06:03.360
I'm very sorry.

06:03.360 --> 06:07.040
I know that thing stepping
on you caused all of this.

06:07.440 --> 06:08.260
Get up.

06:08.260 --> 06:10.060
Don't give her trouble.

06:10.680 --> 06:12.000
By the way,

06:12.320 --> 06:14.620
she hasn't changed a bit.

06:15.300 --> 06:18.320
I have cleaned the bathroom
this morning, you can go…

06:32.860 --> 06:34.120
Master Hitoyoshi?

06:34.340 --> 06:36.440
Ah…

06:36.440 --> 06:37.380
Um…

06:37.600 --> 06:39.900
I… I'll run the hot water.

06:42.580 --> 06:44.500
She hasn't changed.

06:45.320 --> 06:47.460
Although she is slowly
becoming an ordinary person,

06:47.940 --> 06:50.600
the impression she gives stays the same.

06:51.660 --> 06:53.220
So naive and innocent.

06:54.120 --> 06:56.920
Just like a family member,
she admires me openly.

06:57.600 --> 07:00.360
I also like that about her.

07:01.820 --> 07:02.820
Yet…

07:03.140 --> 07:06.220
Yet I wanted to destroy it all.

07:07.080 --> 07:08.960
Sorry, Hitoyoshi.

07:10.140 --> 07:13.440
Hitoyoshi, you are just lonely.

07:14.600 --> 07:17.080
I don't want to go through that again.

07:18.020 --> 07:21.140
If even she leaves me…

07:23.000 --> 07:25.480
Master Hitoyoshi, are you alright?

07:26.120 --> 07:29.090
You've seemed a bit off
since this morning.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.300
ACTIVATE
May I ask if you are feeling unwell?

07:31.300 --> 07:32.360
May I ask if you are feeling unwell?

07:32.360 --> 07:33.560
Ah… no…

07:34.040 --> 07:36.380
I just want to get the hot water ready.

07:36.380 --> 07:37.560
So…

07:38.980 --> 07:40.920
Ah, this bright smile.

07:41.180 --> 07:43.560
It's the expression
when she's ready to let me lie on her lap.

07:43.820 --> 07:47.040
Not when I'm in a turmoil
of emotions, Miss Yuki.

07:47.840 --> 07:50.380
The innocent eyes of a child
in this situation.

07:51.000 --> 07:53.100
This time I really can't lie on her thigh.

07:54.460 --> 07:55.379
Um…

07:55.380 --> 07:57.060
I've wanted to say this before.

07:57.580 --> 08:00.680
Lying on your thigh
makes me a bit embarrassed.

08:00.940 --> 08:02.780
Under 'normal' circumstances,

08:02.780 --> 08:05.660
having a high school student
lie on a woman's thigh

08:05.660 --> 08:08.400
is actually quite challenging.

08:09.300 --> 08:10.300
As expected,

08:10.580 --> 08:13.940
you've also gotten tired of me?

08:14.360 --> 08:16.120
No, I didn't think that…

08:17.200 --> 08:19.280
No matter how much time has passed,

08:25.980 --> 08:28.860
I always fail and never accomplish.

08:32.940 --> 08:34.460
Miss Yuki…

08:34.720 --> 08:35.560
Eh?

08:36.580 --> 08:37.940
Eyes…

08:38.360 --> 08:40.200
My eyes feel warm.

08:40.200 --> 08:42.160
Not only warm, but there is also liquid.

08:47.040 --> 08:48.020
This is…

08:49.220 --> 08:51.560
Sorry, that's not what I meant.

08:51.560 --> 08:53.980
I'm not tired of you.

08:54.660 --> 08:55.840
I made her cry.

08:56.100 --> 08:57.260
What should I do now?

08:57.260 --> 08:58.440
What should I do?

08:59.460 --> 09:00.500
JUST WANT TO ESCAPE FROM THIS SITUATION
I don't know.

09:00.500 --> 09:01.480
JUST WANT TO ESCAPE FROM THIS SITUATION
I don't understand anything.

09:02.200 --> 09:04.840
WOUNDED PRIDE
But I know it's all my fault.

09:05.120 --> 09:06.420
Ah, that's right.

09:06.640 --> 09:07.540
A bath.

09:07.860 --> 09:09.320
You wouldn't want to catch a cold.

09:09.320 --> 09:10.900
Would you like to take a bath?

09:11.500 --> 09:12.720
You are right.

09:13.160 --> 09:14.480
I'll do that.

09:20.900 --> 09:21.780
No.

09:21.780 --> 09:23.180
Why am I talking about taking a bath?

09:23.180 --> 09:24.920
My response just now

09:25.920 --> 09:27.820
was the worst move.

09:30.300 --> 09:33.160
What on earth am I doing?

09:35.160 --> 09:37.740
I made her worry.

09:50.380 --> 09:51.480
Since then…

09:51.780 --> 09:54.260
Oh, did you forget to buy white radishes?

09:54.760 --> 09:57.200
-It doesn't really matter.
-Whenever something happens…

09:57.680 --> 10:00.120
I'm really sorry.

10:00.120 --> 10:02.580
her tears would flood out.

10:03.580 --> 10:04.760
But I…

10:05.460 --> 10:07.880
-You've gotten heavy.
-I don't know how to stop her tears.

10:08.840 --> 10:10.400
I'm really sorry.

10:13.700 --> 10:16.520
I can only use all my wits…

10:21.180 --> 10:22.540
I'm really sorry.

10:22.540 --> 10:23.340
Huh…

10:23.340 --> 10:25.300
… try not to make her sad.

10:27.940 --> 10:29.320
I'm really sorry.

10:30.200 --> 10:31.100
No.

10:31.100 --> 10:33.240
That's not your fault.

10:33.740 --> 10:35.640
As long as it's for her sake,

10:36.380 --> 10:37.980
I can share a bed with her.

10:37.980 --> 10:38.680
Huh…

10:38.980 --> 10:40.720
You can't sleep?

10:41.420 --> 10:42.360
No.

10:42.760 --> 10:43.760
61.

10:43.760 --> 10:44.920
67.

10:44.920 --> 10:46.700
-71, 73.
-For two whole days,

10:46.700 --> 10:49.280
-1091.
-I didn't get a wink of sleep.

10:49.280 --> 10:53.760
1093, 1097, 1103, 1109…

10:54.280 --> 10:55.240
Finally,

10:55.500 --> 10:57.740
it's New Year's Eve.

10:58.580 --> 10:59.720
I'm so sleepy.

10:59.980 --> 11:03.320
But thanks to her help,
the room has been cleaned up.

11:03.660 --> 11:06.500
Next… next year, I must…

11:18.460 --> 11:19.420
Hmm.

11:20.300 --> 11:21.440
So fluffy.

11:23.260 --> 11:24.380
Master Hitoyoshi.

11:24.560 --> 11:27.380
Would you like to go out
for a walk and buy dinner?

11:28.160 --> 11:29.300
Master Hitoyoshi?

11:31.520 --> 11:33.780
I'm going out for a bit.

11:49.080 --> 11:50.560
See you next year.

11:51.240 --> 11:53.420
Hmm, Happy New Year.

11:59.730 --> 12:02.070
CLOSED FOR THE NEW YEAR

12:02.070 --> 12:05.030
KATSUTA DELI

12:05.030 --> 12:06.240
VEGETABLE AND FRUIT SHOP

12:09.080 --> 12:10.280
SOBA NOODLES
Sorry.

12:10.280 --> 12:11.960
SOBA NOODLES
The year-end soba noodles are sold out.

12:11.960 --> 12:13.920
SOBA NOODLES
Oh, I see.

12:14.960 --> 12:16.880
EZEKI MARKET

12:21.240 --> 12:22.220
Uh…

12:22.820 --> 12:23.660
Ah…

12:24.840 --> 12:25.540
Uh…

12:26.100 --> 12:28.510
Big year-end sale.

12:32.480 --> 12:34.740
Osechi sets are right here.

12:36.260 --> 12:38.720
People act completely differently
at the end of the year.

12:47.280 --> 12:49.440
Oh, Miss, you have a good eye.

12:49.440 --> 12:51.540
That's the top-grade roast beef.

12:51.840 --> 12:53.680
How much do you want? The whole piece?

12:53.680 --> 12:55.680
I'll give you a discount.

13:07.360 --> 13:09.900
Master Hitoyoshi, I'm back.

13:10.100 --> 13:11.280
Welcome home.

13:11.620 --> 13:13.000
I went for a walk

13:13.000 --> 13:15.580
and bought dinner on the way.

13:15.580 --> 13:16.960
Eh? Really?

13:17.220 --> 13:21.540
Tonight, I want to make
your favorite okonomiyaki.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.180
And also…

13:23.660 --> 13:24.820
Ta-da.

13:24.820 --> 13:27.060
I also bought some roasted beef.

13:31.400 --> 13:34.700
-Roasted beef…
-Miss Yuki.

13:36.880 --> 13:38.200
Oh my…

13:38.200 --> 13:40.080
They're not completely the same.

13:40.080 --> 13:42.880
I bought it sliced,
you got the whole piece.

13:47.140 --> 13:49.320
Oh, it seems so delicious.

13:49.600 --> 13:50.440
Ah.

13:50.440 --> 13:52.620
You don't have to
force yourself to finish it all.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.160
Okay.

13:54.520 --> 13:56.940
Well then, I'm going to start.

13:57.260 --> 13:58.720
I'm going to start.

14:06.540 --> 14:08.040
So delicious.

14:10.200 --> 14:12.760
-Yes, it's really good.
-What am I doing?

14:13.680 --> 14:16.980
I still made her cry.

14:25.560 --> 14:27.760
I have to pull myself together.

14:33.340 --> 14:36.260
Dad is coming back tomorrow.

14:37.660 --> 14:38.560
Hmm…

15:05.320 --> 15:07.260
Miss Yuki, Brother.

15:07.580 --> 15:09.000
Happy New Year.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.920
I'm taking you to
the New Year's shrine visit.

15:12.360 --> 15:15.060
Good morning, Miss Riko.

15:15.240 --> 15:17.000
Are you ready?

15:17.300 --> 15:18.480
Alright, let's go.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.240
Um…

15:20.860 --> 15:23.600
I tried to wake him, but…

15:24.000 --> 15:25.680
Can't wake him up at all?

15:25.940 --> 15:26.860
No.

15:26.860 --> 15:28.840
He looks quite exhausted.

15:28.840 --> 15:31.300
I see, that's a headache.

15:31.620 --> 15:33.040
Why is that?

15:33.260 --> 15:35.320
Eh? You don't know?

15:35.940 --> 15:37.600
Today is January first.

15:37.600 --> 15:39.840
It's Brother's birthday.

15:40.200 --> 15:41.540
Master Hitoyoshi's…

15:41.540 --> 15:46.440
That's right, so we gather every year
after the New Year's visit.

15:46.440 --> 15:47.820
Master Hitoyoshi's…

15:47.820 --> 15:51.060
Well, there's no need to
give him a birthday present.

15:51.060 --> 15:53.330
It's all the same
whether we prepared or not…

15:54.440 --> 15:57.360
I didn't know today was his birthday.

15:57.360 --> 15:59.660
Do you make this sound when you cry?

16:00.620 --> 16:03.520
It's the first time I've seen you cry.

16:03.520 --> 16:04.600
Yes.

16:04.600 --> 16:05.580
Um…

16:07.740 --> 16:08.860
It seems…

16:09.680 --> 16:13.460
There's something wrong
with my lacrimal glands.

16:13.460 --> 16:14.460
Really?

16:14.460 --> 16:15.440
So,

16:15.780 --> 16:18.620
I might cry over something.

16:19.060 --> 16:21.440
It's best if I stay at home.

16:21.440 --> 16:22.400
Understood.

16:23.220 --> 16:24.500
Don't force yourself.

16:24.500 --> 16:26.840
I also asked some friends
to visit the shrine together.

16:26.840 --> 16:27.840
It's okay.

16:28.580 --> 16:30.400
I'll come again.

16:46.880 --> 16:47.980
Naka.

16:48.340 --> 16:52.940
Are you two going to
the New Year's shrine visit?

16:54.640 --> 16:56.160
THE FORMER ASSASSIN SPEAKING TO THE TEXT MESSAGE
I think I'll stay at home…

16:57.360 --> 17:00.820
I want to go with you.

17:02.340 --> 17:04.080
To the shrine… with Naka.

17:04.080 --> 17:07.040
NEW YEAR'S SHRINE VISIT
To the shrine… with Naka.

17:10.120 --> 17:11.900
Ah, Yuki.

17:12.180 --> 17:14.500
Happy New Year.

17:14.900 --> 17:16.420
You came.

17:16.420 --> 17:17.800
What a cute outfit.

17:18.160 --> 17:19.580
Did you come alone?

17:19.580 --> 17:20.420
Yes.

17:21.280 --> 17:24.920
To be honest, I'm not quite clear on
what a New Year's shrine visit is.

17:24.920 --> 17:25.920
Eh?

17:26.180 --> 17:27.980
So you've never been
to a shrine visit either?

17:27.980 --> 17:28.940
No.

17:28.940 --> 17:31.400
I'm rather unfamiliar
with this sort of thing.

17:31.920 --> 17:33.040
The New Year's shrine visit

17:33.040 --> 17:36.900
is where you tell the deities your wishes
on the first day of every year.

17:37.280 --> 17:38.760
I see.

17:43.620 --> 17:45.220
Those white papers…

17:45.220 --> 17:46.840
Those are Omikuji.

17:47.120 --> 17:49.860
Your fortune for the year
is written on them.

17:50.280 --> 17:51.740
Would you like to draw one?

17:52.100 --> 17:52.980
Okay.

17:57.600 --> 18:01.640
Explaining things she doesn't understand

18:01.640 --> 18:04.240
really feels like what friends do.

18:04.240 --> 18:06.120
But we are already friends.

18:06.120 --> 18:06.880
Hehe.

18:07.420 --> 18:08.680
I drew a 'great fortune'…

18:10.240 --> 18:12.380
Eh, her tears…

18:12.700 --> 18:14.340
She's crying so much as to make a sound?

18:14.620 --> 18:16.580
And she can't stop.

18:16.580 --> 18:18.820
Should we find a place to sit down?

18:23.600 --> 18:26.620
UNCERTAIN LUCK
Lost items, cannot be found, going elsewhere.

18:26.980 --> 18:28.020
It must mean

18:28.820 --> 18:31.920
that I am going to part ways
with Master Hitoyoshi.

18:32.400 --> 18:34.240
That's not true.

18:35.020 --> 18:36.200
But,

18:36.500 --> 18:41.680
his attitude changed lately.

18:42.840 --> 18:44.300
Also towards me…

18:45.400 --> 18:48.720
I feel like he's been
distancing himself from me.

18:50.120 --> 18:51.280
Maybe someday,

18:51.840 --> 18:56.520
he will no longer need me.

18:58.440 --> 19:02.000
Will he leave me?

19:04.860 --> 19:06.260
Whenever I think about that,

19:08.380 --> 19:10.460
I can't stop my tears.

19:12.940 --> 19:15.020
What if…

19:16.200 --> 19:18.380
he hates me…

19:19.780 --> 19:21.780
Actually,

19:22.460 --> 19:25.800
I've also had times
when I couldn't stop crying.

19:26.540 --> 19:27.740
You have, Naka?

19:28.160 --> 19:28.920
Yes.

19:29.140 --> 19:30.720
It was when I was little,

19:31.240 --> 19:34.380
after my mother passed away.

19:35.800 --> 19:38.420
Ah, I didn't mean to make you sad.

19:41.280 --> 19:46.400
Back then, I suddenly remembered
what my mother used to say.

19:47.940 --> 19:52.040
She said tears are the overflow of sorrow.

19:52.620 --> 19:55.120
So she told me to cry
to my heart's content.

19:56.032 --> 19:59.300
I think the reason
you can't stop your tears

19:59.720 --> 20:06.060
is because the sadness building up inside
is finally being released all at once.

20:06.720 --> 20:09.960
So crying is not a bad thing at all.

20:10.640 --> 20:14.320
Before all the sorrow has poured out,

20:14.320 --> 20:17.180
just cry your heart out.

20:17.600 --> 20:19.080
In doing so, there will come a day

20:19.080 --> 20:20.980
when you will find your smile again.

20:21.180 --> 20:22.960
That's what I've gone through.

20:24.340 --> 20:25.520
Naka.

20:27.160 --> 20:29.680
Once you've calmed down,
let's go make a wish

20:29.680 --> 20:32.380
and ask the gods to
bless your fortune-telling.

20:34.200 --> 20:36.020
As for the process of worship…

20:36.020 --> 20:36.880
FUDOUDOU

20:39.560 --> 20:40.500
Bow twice.

20:43.720 --> 20:44.720
Clap twice.

20:51.620 --> 20:55.140
Miss Riko, Naka, and Master Hitoyoshi,

20:55.780 --> 20:57.880
all of them are thinking of me.

20:58.980 --> 21:01.480
I hope that this year, and in the future,

21:01.980 --> 21:04.420
I can always be with them.

21:11.610 --> 21:15.110
DAD CALLING
I'M GOING TO THE NEW YEAR'S SHRINE VISIT. YUKI.
